<title>FINLAND: Finnish August GDP rises 2.1 pct yr/yr - SF.</title>
<headline>Finnish August GDP rises 2.1 pct yr/yr - SF.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finland's gross domestic product (GDP) rose 2.1 percent year-on-year in August, Statistics Finland (SF) said in a statement on Thursday.</p>
<p>Adjusted for seasonal factors, GDP rose 0.3 percent in August on July, SF said.</p>
<p>			 Aug 1996	July 1996	Aug 1995</p>
<p> Yr/yr		  +2.1 pct	 +3.9 pct	 +4.2 pct</p>
<p> Mth/mth		+0.3 pct	 +0.5 pct	  0   pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-0-680 50 245</p>
</text>
